{"name":"Icepick","hex":"#dadcd0","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"icepick","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A pointed tool, shaped like an awl, used for breaking ice.","A type of narrow and deep atrophic (indented) acne scar that resembles a puncture in the skin.   Acne scars on Wikipedia"]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To break or stab with an icepick."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/icepick"}],"entries":[{"title":"Icepick (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Icepick is an American metalcore band formed in 1996. It serves as a side project to Jamey Jasta of Hatebreed, Danny Diablo, and other musicians of the hardcore punk and hip hop scenes. Although founded in 1996, Icepick remained virtually stagnant until the song \"Born to Crush You\" appeared on UFC: Ultimate Beat Downs, Vol. 1 in August 2004. Former UFC heavyweight champion Andrei Arlovski frequently uses their song \"Onward to Victory\" as his entrance music for fights."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/99/2014-06-05_Vainstream_Hatebreed_Jamey_Jasta_05.jpg/330px-2014-06-05_Vainstream_Hatebreed_Jamey_Jasta_05.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Icepick_(band)","wikidata":"Q3147622"},{"title":"Ice pick","blocks":[{"text":"An ice pick is a pointed metal tool used to break, pick or chip at ice. The design consists of a sharp metal spike attached to a handle. Though traditionally made out of wood, modern variants may have a plastic or rubber handle to improve safety and grip. Otherwise, the tool's design has been relatively unchanged since its invention."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ice_pick","wikidata":"Q586319"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/ICEPICK2.jpg/500px-ICEPICK2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/th